    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "For sale, wanted",
     "texto": [
      "Three ways to say that something «is done»:\n\n- Politiken **bliver solgt** overalt. → is sold (action)\n- Politiken **er udsolgt**. → is sold out (state)\n- Politiken **sælges** overalt. → is sold (-s form)\n\nThe **-s** form is the one on signs and ads: **Ure repareres** = Watches are repaired."
     ],
     "tutora": "pensando"
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Units with the same form",
     "texto": [
      "In the plural, these units usually keep the same form: 5 **meter**, 2 **liter**, 300 **gram**."
     ],
     "tutora": "pensando"
    }
   ]
